<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes<br />
<strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p>SCP XXX is a cathode-ray tube TV which creates a field around it. In the field, everything is acting as if it exists in a cartoon. For example, you can´t fall down as long as you don´t look down.</p>
<p>The other anomalous property is that everyone observing a cartoon character in the TV has their brain pattern completely overlapped by the exactly cartoon character that was observed. For example, if you look at a cartoon dinosaur who is sentient, then you will believe you are a cartoon dinosaur.</p>
<p>Origin story: The object was recovered after a raid on the abandoned shopping mall of ████████, what seemed like a Chaos insurgency hideout, turned out to be a place to brainwash people with the help of the TV and a cartoon of chaos insurgency soldiers , into the believe that they are chaos insurgency soldier.</p>

