<p>Hi author,</p>
<p>I'm not the most well-read on the Tales front, but this seems to be a fine, somewhat original starting point for one. Jack Ryan meets SCP.</p>
<p>However, if you want to acquire greenlights, it's important to <em>sell</em> reviewers on your concept, and what you have here just hasn't done that for me. It seems that you either are holding the remainder of the Tale's narrative back to avoid spoilers, or haven't actually thought it through yet beyond the pitch. Either way, you've left me and all your potential greenlighters with precious little to actually judge this concept on.</p>
<p>Execution is everything, and you've given no hints on how you plan to do so. If I were you, I'd start by filling out that &quot;Central Narrative&quot; section with something you think will appeal to readers.</p>

							</div>

								
					
